{"_meta":{"openai/fileParams":["file"],"openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Made the table","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Listening and making the table"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Use this when the user has a voice note that lists things (expenses, orders, stock counts, hours worked) and wants it as a table. Pass the attached audio as file, or audio_url, or audio_base64 (ogg, opus, m4a, mp3, wav, webm, flac or amr; up to about 3 minutes); add language when known. It transcribes the note with free speech-to-text, then copies it into rows and columns. Returns the table, the transcript, the values that may be misheard (unclear), sum checks, CSV text and 24-hour links. Not for meeting transcripts or subtitles.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"examples":[{"audio_base64":"T2dnUwACAAAAAAAAAAA=","language":"en"}],"properties":{"audio_base64":{"description":"The audio bytes as base64, up to 6 MB.","type":"string"},"audio_url":{"description":"A public https link to one voice note (ogg, opus, m4a, mp3, wav, webm, flac or amr), up to 6 MB, about 3 minutes.","maxLength":2000,"type":"string"},"file":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The voice note the user attached in the chat.","properties":{"download_url":{"description":"Temporary link to the uploaded file.","maxLength":4096,"type":"string"},"file_id":{"description":"Id of the uploaded file.","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"file_name":{"maxLength":400,"type":"string"},"mime_type":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"required":["download_url","file_id"],"type":"object"},"hint":{"description":"Optional: what the content is or which columns the person wants, for example 'stock count, item and quantity only'.","maxLength":300,"type":"string"},"language":{"description":"Optional ISO 639-1 code of the spoken language, such as en, vi, es or sw. Without it the language is detected.","pattern":"^[a-z]{2,3}$","type":"st